p25-core — APCO P25 Phase 1 IMBE vocoder and common air interface

All files of this repository are under the licence below, except where it says otherwise:

- parts ported from mbelib (the IMBE parameter decoding and its tables) and from DSD (the P25 Phase 1 frame layout
  and the IMBE interleave schedule): their ISC licences, below, apply to those parts too. The files say which.

IMBE is DVSI's technology: this licence grants no patent rights.

